        "text": "<thinking> To implement the `publish_event.py` file that publishes a JSON event to a managed messaging topic or queue, I need to choose a concrete external provider. Given the context, I will use Amazon SNS (Simple Notification Service) as the provider. This will make the provider identifiable in the code through the use of the `boto3` library, which is the AWS SDK for Python, and the specific SNS client methods. </thinking>\n",
